  "body": "### Summary\nAs a VoiceOver user, I want a failed list load to be announced, so that I know why the list did not refresh.\n\nFollow-up of LOT-162 (#252, PR #715). `LoadFailureBanner` (Navigation/LoadFailureView.swift) is not announced: an `onAppear` trigger was rejected in review (silent on a failed retry while the banner stays, repeats on reappear). A reliable trigger needs a failure counter in `ContentLoader`/the list models, posted with `AccessibilityNotification.Announcement`.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] A failed load, first or retried, is announced once; returning to the screen does not repeat it.\n- [ ] Swift Testing test on the counter, shown to fail without the change.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
